-  * `rm /1/var/lib/openlibrary/coverstore/items/l_cover_0008/l_covers_0008_00.*`
+Existing installations need `failed boolean default false` and `uploaded boolean default false` columns on `cover`, plus `cover_failed_idx` and `cover_uploaded_idx`, before running this version. New installations receive these through `schema.sql` or `schema.py`. Legacy tar-backed records and old cover clusters remain readable by the existing retrieval code; new batches use ZIPs and database URLs.
